# Ignore build outputs recursively
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/artifacts/
**/out/
**/TestResults/

HeroShift\ -\ SRC Files/*/bin/
HeroShift\ -\ SRC Files/*/obj/
WASDMenuAPI\ -\ SRC Files/*/bin/
WASDMenuAPI\ -\ SRC Files/*/obj/

# .NET / MSBuild artifacts
*.exe
*.pdb
*.nupkg
*.runtimeconfig.json
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache

# Logs, caches, temp
*.log
debug_*.txt
perf_*.txt
*.cache
*.tmp
*.temp

# Other common ignores
node_modules/
dist/
.env
